        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: IROC XXV, IROC XXVI\n- Organizations: True Value Company\n- Places: Daytona International Speedway\n- Concepts: True Value International Race of Champions\n\nFacts:\n- IROC XXV was the 25th season of the True Value International Race of Champions, and it began on Friday, February 16, 2001 at Daytona International Speedway.\n- IROC XXVI was the 26th season of the True Value International Race of Champions, and it began on Friday, February 15, 2002 at Daytona International Speedway.\n- The True Value Company is an American retailer-owned hardware cooperative with over 4,000 independent retail locations worldwide.",
